"Interplanetary: Enhanced Edition" are trademarks of their respective owners.

This repository ships no game code, game assets or game data. The mod patches
the game at runtime and needs a legal copy of Interplanetary: Enhanced Edition.
Building from source references the game's own DLLs from your local install;
they are never copied into this repository or into a release.

Third-party software, downloaded separately from its own releases and not
included here:
- BepInEx 5 (LGPL-2.1): https://github.com/BepInEx/BepInEx
- HarmonyX (MIT), bundled with BepInEx: https://github.com/BepInEx/HarmonyX
